   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Frequency and order",
   "texto": [
    "**常常** is «often» and **总是**, «always». **然后** means «after» and links actions. In mandarin the verb is not changed to say «I'm up.», «You're up.» or «It gets up.»."
